Subject: Make the development header path follow pkg-config prefix

OpenWrt relocates prefix into its target staging tree during compilation.

--- a/gsettings-desktop-schemas.pc.in
+++ b/gsettings-desktop-schemas.pc.in
@@ -3,4 +3,4 @@
 Name: gsettings-desktop-schemas
 Description: Shared GSettings schemas for the desktop, including helper headers
 Version: @VERSION@
-Cflags: -I@includedir@/gsettings-desktop-schemas
+Cflags: -I${prefix}/include/gsettings-desktop-schemas
